---
// Impressum — example-org/operations#9. § 5 DDG (which replaced § 5 TMG in 2024).
//
// GERMAN ONLY, and deliberately so. The Impressum is a German statutory
// instrument; publishing an English "version" of it would raise the question
// of which one is binding, and the answer would have to be "the German one"
// anyway. A short English note at the foot points international readers at
// what this page is, without pretending to be a second Impressum.
//
// ── NOT LINKED, NOT INDEXED, ON PURPOSE ─────────────────────────────────────
//
// The address is still missing (a ladungsfähige Anschrift service, deferred
// to public launch). An Impressum without a summonable address is worse than
// no Impressum: an incomplete one is the classic Abmahnung target in Germany,
// and it is worse precisely because it looks compliant. So the page exists,
// is written, and is reachable by URL — but nothing advertises it until the
// address is real. Adding the footer link is part of closing #9, not of
// writing this file.
//
// On the prod origin "unlinked" is not enough on its own: myne.md's
// robots.txt is `Allow: /` and advertises the sitemap, so a page listed
// there gets crawled whether or not anything links to it. Hence two
// measures that belong together — `robots="noindex,nofollow"` below, and the
// `/impressum/` exclusion in astro.config.mjs's sitemap filter. Drop both in
// the same change as the address (example-org/operations#9); dropping one alone
// leaves the page half-published.
//
// Why an Impressum is required at all, for a free non-commercial beta: the
// statutory test is "geschäftsmäßig" — regular and planned provision, not
// profit. A continuously running sync service meets it. The law also covers
// services "normally provided for remuneration", and note sync is a paid
// category elsewhere (Obsidian Sync, Notesnook, Joplin Cloud). See #9.
import LandingLayout from "../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
import GlassNav from "../components/GlassNav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { absoluteOg } from "../lib/og";

const title = "Impressum — Myne";
const description =
  "Anbieterkennzeichnung nach § 5 DDG für myne.md und den Modelldownload-Ursprung.";
const canonical = new URL("/impressum/", Astro.site!).toString();
const ogImage = absoluteOg("impressum", Astro.site!);

const eyebrow = "font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;";
const h2 =
  "font-size:clamp(19px,2.2vw,25px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin-top:56px;";
const body =
  "margin-top:14px;max-width:68ch;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-3);";
const cardStyle =
  "border:1px solid rgb(var(--line-rgb) / 0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;background:var(--paper-2);margin-top:22px;";
// The placeholder is styled to read as a gap rather than as content, so it
// cannot be mistaken for an address at a glance.
const pending =
  "display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border:1px dashed rgb(var(--line-rgb) / 0.28);border-radius:5px;color:var(--ink-3);font-size:13px;";
---

<LandingLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  ogImage={ogImage}
  robots="noindex,nofollow"
>
  <div
    style="font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink-1);background:var(--paper);min-height:100vh;"
  >
    <GlassNav active="legal" />

    <section id="top" style="padding:var(--page-top) var(--gutter) 70px;">
      <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
        <div class="mono up" style={eyebrow}>Rechtliches</div>
        <h1
          style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.05;"
        >
          Impressum
        </h1>
        <p style={body}>
          Anbieterkennzeichnung nach § 5 DDG für myne.md und den Modelldownload-Ursprung sowie die
          Desktop-, Mobil- und Browser-Anwendungen.
        </p>

        <h2 style={h2}>Diensteanbieter</h2>
        <div style={cardStyle}>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-1);">
            Ömer Duran
          </p>
          <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-3);">
            <span style={pending}>Anschrift folgt zum öffentlichen Start</span>
          </p>
          <p style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-3);">
            Deutschland
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 style={h2}>Kontakt</h2>
        <div style={cardStyle}>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-3);">
            E-Mail: <a href="mailto:hello@myne.md" style="color:var(--accent);">hello@myne.md</a><br />
            Datenschutz: <a href="mailto:privacy@myne.md" style="color:var(--accent);">privacy@myne.md</a
            ><br />
            Meldungen rechtswidriger Inhalte:
            <a href="mailto:abuse@myne.md" style="color:var(--accent);">abuse@myne.md</a><br />
            Behörden: <a href="mailto:legal@myne.md" style="color:var(--accent);">legal@myne.md</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p style={body}>
          Eine Telefonnummer wird nicht vorgehalten; die Erreichbarkeit ist über die genannten
          E-Mail-Adressen sichergestellt, die von einem Menschen gelesen werden.
        </p>

        <h2 style={h2}>Verantwortlich für redaktionelle Inhalte</h2>
        <p style={body}>
          Verantwortlich im Sinne des § 18 Abs. 2 MStV für die redaktionellen Inhalte dieser Website
          ist Ömer Duran, Anschrift wie oben.
        </p>

        <h2 style={h2}>Umsatzsteuer</h2>
        <p style={body}>
          Eine Umsatzsteuer-Identifikationsnummer besteht nicht. Der Dienst wird unentgeltlich und
          nicht gewerblich angeboten; es werden keine Zahlungen entgegengenommen.
        </p>

        <h2 style={h2}>Verbraucherstreitbeilegung</h2>
        <p style={body}>
          Wir sind weder bereit noch verpflichtet, an Streitbeilegungsverfahren vor einer
          Verbraucherschlichtungsstelle teilzunehmen (§ 36 VSBG).
        </p>

        <h2 style={h2}>Aufsichtsbehörde für den Datenschutz</h2>
        <p style={body}>
          Die Landesbeauftragte für den Datenschutz und für das Recht auf Akteneinsicht Brandenburg,
          Stahnsdorfer Damm 77, 14532 Kleinmachnow. Was verarbeitet wird, steht in der
          <a href="/datenschutz/" style="color:var(--accent);">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.
        </p>

        <p style={body + "margin-top:44px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-3);"}>
          This page is the provider identification required of German service providers by § 5 DDG.
          It is published in German because that is the language the obligation is written in, and
          the German text is the binding one. What we do with data is in the
          <a href="/privacy/" style="color:var(--accent);">Privacy Policy</a>; the terms of the free beta
          are in the <a href="/terms/" style="color:var(--accent);">Beta Terms</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SiteFooter />
  </div>
</LandingLayout>
